TITLE Exchange transport test
SOLUTION 0 Infilling
    pH 7.0
    pe 4
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    pe 4
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    equilibrate 1
    X 0.001
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -simulation true
    -state true
    -solution true
    -distance true
    -time true
    -pH true
    -pe true
END
